<title>USA: IDM Environmental sees 1996 loss.</title>
<headline>IDM Environmental sees 1996 loss.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH RIVER, N.J. 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>IDM Environmental Corp said Tuesday it expected to report a loss for 1996, due to previously announced delays to several projects and significant increases in services on two large government projects.</p>
<p>The company said it expected to report full-year 1996 revenues of about $25 million compared with 1995 revenues of $39.4 million. Preliminary data suggested fourth quarter revenues would be in the range of $7 million, versus $6.6 million a year ago, it said.</p>
</text>
